error[elab/operator-binop-type-mismatch]: operator '+' is not defined for 'nat' and 'bool'
  ┌─ elab/operator-binary-right-type.watsup:2:10
  │
1 │ dec $f : nat
  │          --- return value of function '$f' expects 'nat'
2 │ def $f = 1 + false
